   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# regions from sam3\n\n1. The **sample facade** node is the picture (your own: Load Image). SAM 3.1 loads with Load Checkpoint (`sam3.1_multiplex_fp16`).\n2. **Text**: one line per kind of object, `name = text : N` (N = max hits, default 50). Every hit is a mask `name_01..` in reading order. Hits that cover a whole row of other hits are dropped (`drop_groups`).\n3. **Points Editor** (width/height = matrix size): shift+click one point per object, shift+right click for points to exclude, ctrl+drag for a box. `point_names` names them in click order, then boxes.\n4. **detail** re-segments every clicked object / box on a square crop at full resolution (edges follow balusters, frames).\n5. `save_folder`: write every mask as `<name>.png` into the project, e.g. `...\\Masks\\SAM` (existing files kept unless `overwrite`).\n6. Regions From Masks patches them on top of a atlas (mute the atlas and unplug `base_regions` for SAM regions alone).\n\nTest run on a facade: 41 windows, 5 balustrades, 3 clicks, 1 box in ~24 s.\n"
   ],
   "title": "Read me"
  }
 ],
